<title>UKRAINE: Ukraine November inflation lower at 1.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Ukraine November inflation lower at 1.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukrainian consumer prices rose by 1.2 percent in November after a 1.5 percent rise in October, the Statistics Ministry said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    UKRAINE CONSUMER PRICES	 Nov 96    Oct 96   Nov 95</p>
<p>    month-on-month pct change	+1.2     +1.5     +6.2</p>
<p>    vs end of previous year	 +38.5    +36.8   +169.3</p>
<p>The government has forecast yearly inflation of less than 40 percent in 1996 and about 25 percent in 1997, after 181.7 percent in 1995.</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
